5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I think we should look at the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs and the time lost to copying existing records to see where the real problems are.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I'll go with staffing of the coordination group and in-house developer availability. We can't just assume people have the time to actually build these things.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll check network coverage at customer plants and vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work. It's better to know the actual constraints before we get carried away.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I will look into the capital budget and software allowance, as well as the handling of vendor queries. We need to be clear on the financial boundaries first.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'll take the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts. I want to see what actually worked in the past!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
