11,1,2,talk,May,,"Does anyone else think we should check the coordination group's workload, or are we satisfied with my choice?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, your choice covers it. I'm more interested in whether the external environment even supports the ideas we're about to see.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Shunichi. We must ensure the funding source is compatible with the project's cost structure before we commit.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I think it's great we're covering the budget and the staff, but I really believe the history of our rollouts will tell us which proposals are actually realistic!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
