16,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm satisfied with our current list. It seems we've covered the budget, the people, and the technical side. I'll stick with my two.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'm also satisfied. We have a comprehensive spread of data points. I'll stick with my selections.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also maintain my choices. It is prudent to have a clear picture of the budget and vendor interactions before we evaluate the candidates.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
